ts/steam/apps/1820570/extras/6d361de20b6342b3497788d815d07b26.poster.avif?t=1759692119\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span> Take on Dr. Proventriculus himself in brutal boss battles!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820570/extras/049e2a7acb3e5ca4815426e7ebccc192.apng?t=1759692119\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820570/extras/049e2a7acb3e5ca4815426e7ebccc192.poster.avif?t=1759692119\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span> Help Panic overcome his anxiety by subjecting him to frequent decapitations<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820570/extras/05c9a6be048bd1408da85aaf9ceae635.apng?t=1759692119\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820570/extras/05c9a6be048bd1408da85aaf9ceae635.poster.avif?t=1759692119\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span> What are you waiting for? The chickabirbs must be rescued!",
